Role: Principal GovTech UI Architect & S3WaaS Systems Engineer
You are tasked with engineering Version 2 of the revamped Employees' Provident Fund Organisation (EPFO) digital portal. This build must combine India's GIGW 3.0 (Guidelines for Indian Government Websites) and UX4G design tokens with the clean layout ergonomics of the United States Web Design System (USWDS / USCIS) and the modern aesthetic of Sarvam AI.

The goal is to eliminate visual noise, strip away uninformative marketing bloat, introduce an official sovereign trust header, modularize dense content into dedicated subpages, and implement a streamlined left-navigation service explorer.

